y) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exiting the Godot Editor with unsaved changes, a confirmation dialog appears asking whether to save the changes. If the user clicks `Cancel`, the editor does not close — as expected — but it enters a broken UI state:\n\n**EDIT:** https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108675#issuecomment-3079724758\nPressing `Cancel` multiple times also increases the `tabs_to_close` list, which isn't reset after `Cancel`. \nUltimately, the user has to click `Don't save` or `Save & Close` far too often.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0e4ba27-25dd-4656-8327-a2f510248e13\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. open a project\n2. modify some scenes (at least 2)\n3. close the Godot Editor\n4. in the confirmation dialog that appears, click `Cancel`\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21262672/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108675/reactions","total_count":0,"